  "question": {
    "text": "A solution of $\\mathrm{NH}_{4} \\mathrm{Cl}$ and $\\mathrm{NH}_{3}$ has $\\mathrm{pH}=8.0 .$ Which of the following hydroxides may be precipitated when this solution is mixed with equal volume of 0.2 M of metal ion.",
